<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:13.400" end="00:00:16.700" style="s2">Look what you did. You ruined my perfect</p>
<p begin="00:00:15.200" end="00:00:17.600" style="s2">clip and made me look stupid in front of</p>
<p begin="00:00:16.700" end="00:00:20.800" style="s2">everybody.</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.600" end="00:00:20.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can&#39;t help being in a wheelchair.</p>
<p begin="00:00:23.200" end="00:00:27.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then a wheelchair doesn&#39;t belong here.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.600" end="00:00:31.300" style="s2">Sports aren&#39;t for wheelchair people.</p>
<p begin="00:00:27.400" end="00:00:31.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s okay, love. I&#39;ll handle this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.800" end="00:00:34.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can&#39;t you see you&#39;re in the way? If you</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.300" end="00:00:36.600" style="s2">want to watch me play, go watch from</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.600" end="00:00:37.200" style="s2">outside or go home and watch my live on</p>
<p begin="00:00:36.600" end="00:00:38.800" style="s2">YouTube.</p>
<p begin="00:00:37.200" end="00:00:40.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not going anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.800" end="00:00:42.000" style="s2">I&#39;m right behind the court line. You</p>
<p begin="00:00:40.300" end="00:00:44.600" style="s2">fell because you&#39;re bad and you didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:00:42.000" end="00:00:46.300" style="s2">manage the space you had.</p>
<p begin="00:00:44.600" end="00:00:49.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The live chat isn&#39;t liking this. Do</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.300" end="00:00:49.800" style="s2">something. Show them who&#39;s boss.</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.600" end="00:00:59.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give it back to me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:57.700" end="00:01:00.700" style="s2">If you want it, come get it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:59.700" end="00:01:03.000" style="s2">I&#39;ll give it back when you leave the</p>
<p begin="00:01:00.700" end="00:01:03.000" style="s2">court.</p>
<p begin="00:01:06.800" end="00:01:09.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I already told you I&#39;m not going</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.000" end="00:01:10.300" style="s2">anywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:01:09.200" end="00:01:13.200" style="s2">You may think you&#39;re famous, but you</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.300" end="00:01:13.200" style="s2">don&#39;t own this court.</p>
<p begin="00:01:15.400" end="00:01:20.700" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Well, at least I have a real ball. What</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.000" end="00:01:20.700" style="s2">is this junk? A museum piece?</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.600" end="00:01:25.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s a ball with a lot of history to</p>
<p begin="00:01:23.000" end="00:01:25.300" style="s2">tell.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.800" end="00:01:31.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let it go tell its story somewhere</p>
<p begin="00:01:28.200" end="00:01:31.000" style="s2">far from here.</p>
<p begin="00:01:34.976" end="00:01:36.996" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:01:44.300" end="00:01:47.600" style="s2">Did you see that?</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.700" end="00:01:50.600" style="s2">That&#39;s what a real athlete does.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.600" end="00:01:53.800" style="s2">Somebody call the NFL. [laughter] 25,000</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.600" end="00:01:57.700" style="s2">people just watched me DO THAT, BABE.</p>
<p begin="00:01:53.800" end="00:01:57.700" style="s2">YEAH. THAT&#39;S HOW IT&#39;S DONE.</p>
<p begin="00:02:08.092" end="00:02:11.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU BETTER RUN OVER THERE AND GET THAT</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.092" end="00:02:13.621" style="s2">BALL BEFORE somebody takes it. Oh, I</p>
<p begin="00:02:11.192" end="00:02:15.641" style="s2">forgot. You can&#39;t run.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.621" end="00:02:15.641" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.206" end="00:02:21.892" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.492" end="00:02:24.892" style="s2">Now this is a real ball, a brand name,</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.892" end="00:02:24.892" style="s2">something you&#39;ll never have.</p>
<p begin="00:02:31.092" end="00:02:35.592" style="s2">Come on, on top of being in a</p>
<p begin="00:02:32.092" end="00:02:35.592" style="s2">wheelchair, are you blind now too?</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.892" end="00:02:50.492" style="s2">If you want to throw it hard, you need</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.592" end="00:02:50.492" style="s2">to place your feet better.</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.092" end="00:02:57.092" style="s2">You want to teach me basketball? That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:02:54.892" end="00:02:59.792" style="s2">hilarious. Do you know who I am? Do you</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.092" end="00:02:59.792" style="s2">know my career?</p>
<p begin="00:03:01.892" end="00:03:05.892" style="s2">You see where my ball stopped?</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:07.792" style="s2">If you make the shot from there, I&#39;ll</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.892" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">leave. If I make it, you apologize to</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.792" end="00:03:09.892" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.227" end="00:03:16.792" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:03:14.692" end="00:03:18.592" style="s2">Look at this, everybody. The wheelchair</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.792" end="00:03:20.692" style="s2">guy disguised as a homeless man over</p>
<p begin="00:03:18.592" end="00:03:23.092" style="s2">there is challenging me. So let&#39;s do</p>
<p begin="00:03:20.692" end="00:03:23.092" style="s2">this.</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.892" end="00:03:35.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My boyfriend is the best. He plays so</p>
<p begin="00:03:34.192" end="00:03:37.192" style="s2">well and I manage his audience and his</p>
<p begin="00:03:35.992" end="00:03:38.392" style="s2">status.</p>
<p begin="00:03:37.192" end="00:03:40.092" style="s2">You two had better keep the deal and</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.392" end="00:03:43.492" style="s2">leave when you lose. I don&#39;t want to</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.092" end="00:03:44.992" style="s2">upset my people anymore with your kind.</p>
<p begin="00:03:43.492" end="00:03:46.192" style="s2">If you think your boyfriend is good,</p>
<p begin="00:03:44.992" end="00:03:48.392" style="s2">it&#39;s because you haven&#39;t seen my husband</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.192" end="00:03:48.392" style="s2">play.</p>
<p begin="00:04:09.557" end="00:04:11.577" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.487" end="00:04:15.507" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:04:19.994" end="00:04:21.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.694" end="00:04:32.294" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t count. He got really lucky.</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.394" end="00:04:33.794" style="s2">The wind helped him.</p>
<p begin="00:04:32.294" end="00:04:35.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t need the wind or legs to beat</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.794" end="00:04:39.094" style="s2">you. Let&#39;s go. Just you and me on the</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.394" end="00:04:39.094" style="s2">court. First to 11 points wins.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.273" end="00:04:46.293" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:04:52.894" end="00:04:58.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THIS HAS TO BE A JOKE.</p>
<p begin="00:04:55.094" end="00:04:58.494" style="s2">WAIT HERE. I&#39;LL BE RIGHT BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:05:14.994" end="00:05:18.794" style="s2">So let&#39;s do this.</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.594" end="00:05:20.794" style="s2">If you beat me, I&#39;ll give you my car.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.794" end="00:05:21.994" style="s2">But if I win, you give me that gold ring</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:24.494" style="s2">of yours. It&#39;s the only thing you have</p>
<p begin="00:05:21.994" end="00:05:24.494" style="s2">of value.</p>
<p begin="00:05:25.794" end="00:05:29.594" style="s2">Unfortunately, I can&#39;t accept that bet.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.394" end="00:05:42.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can accept it, love.</p>
<p begin="00:05:39.994" end="00:05:42.694" style="s2">I trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:05:44.594" end="00:05:47.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let&#39;s go then.</p>
<p begin="00:05:53.894" end="00:05:57.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you go crazy? If you lose the</p>
<p begin="00:05:55.694" end="00:05:57.794" style="s2">Mustang, our relationship ends right</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.294" end="00:06:00.494" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:05:57.794" end="00:06:01.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Relax, babe. There&#39;s no chance I lose.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.494" end="00:06:04.094" style="s2">Look at him. The guy can&#39;t even stand</p>
<p begin="00:06:01.894" end="00:06:04.094" style="s2">up.</p>
<p begin="00:06:04.194" end="00:06:07.695" style="s2">Here, take one to calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:06:12.695" end="00:06:18.595" style="s2">isn&#39;t about the car or the ring.</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.295" end="00:06:18.595" style="s2">It&#39;s my dignity on the line.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.595" end="00:06:24.295" style="s2">You can start. I&#39;ll go easy on you.</p>
<p begin="00:06:29.995" end="00:06:32.595" style="s2">GET STUCK.</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.495" end="00:06:45.095" style="s2">I WAS GIVING YOU A CHANCE. SINCE YOU</p>
<p begin="00:06:43.195" end="00:06:47.395" style="s2">WANT TO PLAY SERIOUSLY, let&#39;s go.</p>
<p begin="00:06:45.095" end="00:06:47.395" style="s2">Check.</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.195" end="00:06:51.695" style="s2">My ball.</p>
<p begin="00:06:57.795" end="00:07:00.495" style="s2">DON&#39;T STEP.</p>
<p begin="00:07:05.195" end="00:07:09.195" style="s2">COME ON. GET STUCK. GO.</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.295" end="00:07:17.195" style="s2">WE WE WE GOT SLEEP. I&#39;M DEAD.</p>
<p begin="00:07:17.544" end="00:07:19.564" style="s2">[cheering]</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.895" end="00:07:38.295" style="s2">MARCUS NINE, CHASE TWO.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.895" end="00:07:43.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, CHASE.</p>
<p begin="00:07:46.995" end="00:07:51.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How are you doing this, you</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.995" end="00:07:53.595" style="s2">The body matters, but what rules is the</p>
<p begin="00:07:51.695" end="00:07:55.395" style="s2">head. All I did was analyze your</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.595" end="00:07:56.395" style="s2">movement pattern.</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.395" end="00:07:57.695" style="s2">Besides, you&#39;re under pressure and</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.395" end="00:08:00.595" style="s2">making silly mistakes all the time,</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.695" end="00:08:00.595" style="s2">creating openings.</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.295" end="00:08:08.297" style="s2"></p>
<p begin="00:08:10.697" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You idiot, you&#39;re going to lose. I</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.397" end="00:08:16.097" style="s2">warned you, but you never listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.597" end="00:08:26.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look, I have to admit you surprised me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.197" end="00:08:55.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened? Some problem with that</p>
<p begin="00:08:52.797" end="00:08:55.797" style="s2">old wheelchair of yours?</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.597" end="00:09:25.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.797" end="00:09:27.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know, but it&#39;s heavy to move the</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.097" end="00:09:27.597" style="s2">wheels.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.597" end="00:09:36.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me, you need to leave. You&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.097" end="00:09:36.197" style="s2">getting in the way of the game.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.497" end="00:09:47.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come and get me.</p>
<p begin="00:09:52.097" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re too slow.</p>
<p begin="00:09:58.397" end="00:10:02.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s nine for my boyfriend and eight for</p>
<p begin="00:10:00.797" end="00:10:05.797" style="s2">the guy who&#39;s about to lose his ring in</p>
<p begin="00:10:02.497" end="00:10:05.797" style="s2">an epic comeback.</p>
<p begin="00:10:20.198" end="00:10:24.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down, love. Trust me. I&#39;m going to</p>
<p begin="00:10:22.398" end="00:10:27.198" style="s2">win this game for us and to teach these</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.498" end="00:10:27.198" style="s2">kids a lesson.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.452" end="00:11:09.472" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.072" end="00:11:12.092" style="s2">[crying]</p>
<p begin="00:11:13.898" end="00:11:16.798" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The sponsor wants to talk to you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.698" end="00:11:18.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good afternoon. How are you?</p>
<p begin="00:11:16.798" end="00:11:20.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We know everything already. We received</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.398" end="00:11:21.598" style="s2">several reports about your live stream</p>
<p begin="00:11:20.198" end="00:11:23.498" style="s2">where it clearly shows you tampering</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.598" end="00:11:25.098" style="s2">with his wheelchair. To avoid damaging</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.498" end="00:11:26.098" style="s2">our image, we are ending all contracts</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.098" end="00:11:29.298" style="s2">effective now.</p>
<p begin="00:11:26.098" end="00:11:29.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, I can explain. That wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:11:36.598" end="00:11:40.698" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s over, you idiot. You lost the car</p>
<p begin="00:11:38.898" end="00:11:44.498" style="s2">and the sponsorship, and so you lost me,</p>
<p begin="00:11:40.698" end="00:11:47.498" style="s2">too. There&#39;s nothing left for you.</p>
<p begin="00:11:44.498" end="00:11:47.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait, let&#39;s talk.</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.798" end="00:12:14.199" style="s2">Here.</p>
<p begin="00:12:12.798" end="00:12:15.399" style="s2">There&#39;s still one point left, but you&#39;ve</p>
<p begin="00:12:14.199" end="00:12:17.199" style="s2">already proven you&#39;re better, and I</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.399" end="00:12:18.599" style="s2">don&#39;t deserve anything anymore. I lost</p>
<p begin="00:12:17.199" end="00:12:20.899" style="s2">everything I had because I was too proud</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.599" end="00:12:20.899" style="s2">to see.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.899" end="00:12:29.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s all right, Frank.</p>
<p begin="00:12:26.699" end="00:12:29.299" style="s2">Keep the car.</p>
<p begin="00:12:30.799" end="00:12:33.999" style="s2">You&#39;re not a bad person.</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.799" end="00:12:36.999" style="s2">You just have to choose better the</p>
<p begin="00:12:33.999" end="00:12:36.999" style="s2">people you want around you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.999" end="00:12:47.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thank you.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.099" end="00:12:49.999" style="s2">And I&#39;m sorry for everything I said</p>
<p begin="00:12:47.599" end="00:12:49.999" style="s2">today.</p>
<p begin="00:12:51.299" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">Help me become a really good player.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.699" end="00:12:56.799" style="s2">I can pay for private lessons.</p>
<p begin="00:13:02.733" end="00:13:07.099" style="s2">[snorts] You humiliated me sitting down.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.299" end="00:13:08.999" style="s2">You must have been one hell of a player.</p>
<p begin="00:13:07.099" end="00:13:10.699" style="s2">Every Tuesday and Thursday then.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.999" end="00:13:13.499" style="s2">You&#39;ll be my legs, and I&#39;ll teach you</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.699" end="00:13:13.499" style="s2">everything I&#39;ve learned.</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
